ed the distribution route of the Iaso's Boxes."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Military Leader","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's some serious allegations you're raising against the military, you know that? I want to talk to your boss."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Sterling","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sterling","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once we complete the search, you will naturally get to meet our superior."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The soldier's fury is evident on his face, but as his anger reaches its peak, he slowly raises a hand, signaling his subordinates to step back."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Military Leader","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You'd better pray you find something, or you'll regret coming here today, I promise you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Sterling","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sterling","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Led by Brigitte, the Stasi agents open up a military supply crate."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Clatter. Clatter."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Crates are opened one after the other, each like a gavel strike sealing the judgment of fate."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Over half of the military supplies have already been opened. 